  "notes": "Tutorial: Train Your First Robot\n\nWATCH THE DEMO (click 'Show Me'):\n\n1. TRAINING PHASE:\n   - Click robot to start training (yellow glow)\n   - Drag the 5 into the box\n   - Click robot to stop training\n   Robot learned: 'move a number into the box'\n\n2. EXECUTION PHASE:\n   - Click robot to run it\n   - Robot picks up ANY number and moves it!\n   - Keep clicking to run again...\n   - Watch it process ALL numbers!\n\nTHE KEY INSIGHT:\nWe trained with 5, but robot works on ANY number!\nThis is GENERALIZATION - the foundation of programming.\n\nTry it yourself:\n- Click Reset to start over\n- Train the robot differently\n- See what happens!",
